      "published_at": "2008-08-01",
      "source": "wotc",
      "comment": "Helix Pinnacle\u2019s triggered ability has an \u201cintervening \u2018if\u2019 clause.\u201d That means (1) the ability won\u2019t trigger at all unless Helix Pinnacle already has 100 or more tower counters on it as your upkeep begins, and (2) the ability will do nothing if Helix Pinnacle has lost enough counters such that it has fewer than 100 counters on it when the ability resolves."
